The report is readable on a phone: normal text size, key figures in one column, wide tables swipe sideways. The page used to lay itself out at desktop width and scale everything down.

The form remembers language, meal window, the checkboxes and your own slot times. All of it stays on the device; "Forget my settings" clears it.

Overlapping slot times are now refused. Before, a meal in the overlap counted towards the earlier slot while the report showed the later slot's hours.
